+-- sky-blue neckline, a sky sash drawn in by a dark steel waist band, a white
+-- bustle bow behind, and the white upper skirt hung from the thighs. The upper
+-- skirt is a wide white shell round each thigh with a sky hip band over its top
+-- and a sky train down its back, the first tier of the bell.
+local ArmourLookTypes = require("../../ArmourLookTypes")
+local Kit = require("./Kit")
+
+local p = {
+	white = { 190, 196, 206 },
+	sky = { 104, 140, 172 },
